  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-0?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=grey\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/princparshia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-Profile-0?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=teal\" alt=\"MyProfile\"></a></p>\n<p>✨ 喜歡更寫實的外觀，但又想搭配 <strong>Bare Bones</strong> 風格嗎？試試 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bare-bones-bushy-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones - Bushy Leaves</a></strong></p>\n<p>📗 <strong>描述</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>這是為 Bare Bones 材質包量身打造的活力附加包，為 Minecraft 的樹葉與植被注入清新且具風格化的外觀。它重新設計了橡木、雲杉及所有其他樹葉的材質，在維持 Bare Bones 乾淨、極簡設計的同時，增添更多視覺層次。對於追求簡約卻沉浸感的玩家而言，此材質包能完美融入原始美學。搭配 Bare Bones 一同使用，享受流暢且精緻的遊戲體驗！</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kcbhosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d66\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PrincParshia/Resources/refs/heads/main/OFFICIAL_-_KCB_Hosting_Partnership_Banners_837x80_12.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
